---
import '../styles/home-turntable.css';
import PageTransitionHead from '../components/PageTransitionHead.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>谢擎宇｜产品体验设计师</title>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#F7F7F4">
  <meta name="description" content="谢擎宇的产品体验设计作品集，包含房产 GIS、AI 评审、品牌系统提案与执行网查询助手四个案例。">
  <PageTransitionHead />
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">跳到主要内容</a>
<header class="bar">
  <a class="bar__name" href="#main">谢擎宇</a>
</header>
<main class="stage" id="main" tabindex="-1">
  <div class="showcase">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="intro">
      <h1 id="home-title">产品体验设计师</h1>
      <p class="intro__lead">我做复杂业务的产品设计，也用 AI 把方案做成能操作、能检查的工具。这里有房产管理的交互重构、设计评审规则，以及从真实查询需求发展出的本地助手。</p>
      <div class="intro__actions"><a class="resume" href="/resume/xie-qingyu-resume.pdf" download="谢擎宇-体验设计师简历.pdf">下载简历 · PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a href="mailto:second988@qq.com">second988@qq.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="workstation">
  <div class="listening">
  <section class="collection" id="selected-work" aria-label="作品唱片架">
    <p class="collection__hint"><span class="collection__hint-hover">悬停换片 · 点击看案例</span><span class="collection__hint-touch">点击封面，查看案例</span></p>
    <ul class="crate" aria-label="作品索引">
      <li>
        <a class="sleeve" href="/work/real-estate-gis/" data-select="0" style="--disc: #ed5636" aria-current="true" aria-controls="work-0" aria-label="打开房产 GIS 体验重构">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/gis-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"><span class="sleeve__open" aria-hidden="true">查看案例</span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">01</span><span class="sleeve__title">房产 GIS 体验重构<span class="sleeve__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8" /></svg></span></span></span>
        <span class="sleeve__stage">回溯原型</span></a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="sleeve" href="/work/edgecase-planner/" data-select="1" style="--disc: #328bd2" aria-current="false" aria-controls="work-1" aria-label="打开 AI 评审工作流案例">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/review-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"><span class="sleeve__open" aria-hidden="true">查看案例</span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">02</span><span class="sleeve__title">AI 评审工作流<span class="sleeve__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8" /></svg></span></span></span>
        <span class="sleeve__stage">规则实践</span></a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="sleeve" href="/work/brand-system/" data-select="2" style="--disc: #e6b42e" aria-current="false" aria-controls="work-2" aria-label="打开新禾智飞品牌系统提案">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/brand-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"><span class="sleeve__open" aria-hidden="true">查看案例</span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">03</span><span class="sleeve__title">新禾智飞品牌系统<span class="sleeve__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8" /></svg></span></span></span>
        <span class="sleeve__stage">品牌提案</span></a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="sleeve" href="/work/execution-query/" data-select="3" style="--disc: #36a879" aria-current="false" aria-controls="work-3" aria-label="打开执行网查询助手">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/query-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"><span class="sleeve__open" aria-hidden="true">查看案例</span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">04</span><span class="sleeve__title">执行网查询助手<span class="sleeve__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8" /></svg></span></span></span>
        <span class="sleeve__stage">本地工具</span></a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
    <div class="player">
<div class="deck" data-deck data-phase="idle" role="img" aria-label="唱机，当前唱片为房产 GIS 体验重构">

      <span class="deck__frame" aria-hidden="true"></span>

      <div class="platter" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="record" data-record>
          <span class="record__grooves"></span>
          <span class="record__label"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="arm" data-arm aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="arm__weight"></span>
        <span class="arm__pivot"></span>
        <span class="arm__head"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="tuner" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="tuner__scale"></span>
        <span class="tuner__needle"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="deck__foot" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="deck__spec">33⅓ RPM</span>
        <span class="deck__led"></span>
      </div>

    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="panel" aria-label="当前作品介绍">
    <div class="panel__head">
      <div class="sides" role="group" aria-label="切换介绍内容">
        <button class="side" type="button" data-side="a" aria-pressed="true">A 面 · 设计思路</button>
        <button class="side" type="button" data-side="b" aria-pressed="false">B 面 · 交付与阶段</button>
      </div>
      <p class="panel__keys"><span><button type="button" data-direction="left" aria-label="上一张唱片">←</button><button type="button" data-direction="right" aria-label="下一张唱片">→</button> 选作品</span><span><button type="button" data-direction="up" aria-label="切换 A/B 面">↑</button><button type="button" data-direction="down" aria-label="切换 A/B 面">↓</button> 切换 A/B 面</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel__body">
      <article class="work" id="work-0" data-work="0" aria-labelledby="work-title-0">
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-0">房产 GIS 体验重构</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a">三个单元各有一间 1501 室，只看房号还无法确定是哪一户。我用保留单元与楼层关系的矩阵展示房屋，再让测绘核对中的新旧户室并排出现。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden>个人回溯重构，交付总图、整幢和测绘核对三个可操作原型。可以对照旧稿查看布局变化，再用演示数据检查选择、关联和异常反馈。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-1" data-work="1" aria-labelledby="work-title-1" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-1">把设计经验整理成可复用的 AI 工作流</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a">让 AI 参与评审以后，我发现它会把上传与预审混成一个问题，也会漏掉输入限制。我据此修改检查指令和规则，保留原版与测试记录，逐项检查修改是否有效。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden>个人工具实践，交付 Plan / Review 规则、评审记录与版本对照。案例展示一次指令修订和一次规则扩展，并用真实设计稿说明业务答复怎样改变建议。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-2" data-work="2" aria-labelledby="work-title-2" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-2">新禾智飞品牌系统提案</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a">不同供应商做出的物料，需要保留同一个品牌的识别。我把四种标识组合与使用场景对应起来，根据海报信息量和封面裁切范围安排模板，让规则对应到具体版面。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden>品牌提案，包含 24 页规范与六个子系统。案例包含规范原件、海报模板对照和物料提案。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-3" data-work="3" aria-labelledby="work-title-3" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-3">执行网查询助手</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a">律师要反复核查同一批公司。官网更换验证方式后，我保留官网的人工验证，让工具接续查询；结果中把“无记录”和“未完成”分开，避免把查询中断当成案件消失。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden>本地工具已实现名单查询、任务历史与三表 Excel 导出。2026 年 9 月 12 日完成两项合成任务的浏览器试用，案例保留实际交接过程与结果检查。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="sr-only" data-announcement aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
    <noscript><p class="no-script">四个案例可以直接阅读 <a href="/work/real-estate-gis/">房产 GIS</a>、<a href="/work/edgecase-planner/">AI 评审</a>、<a href="/work/brand-system/">品牌系统提案</a>、<a href="/work/execution-query/">执行网助手</a>。</p></noscript>
  </section>
  </div>
  </div>
  <section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <h2 id="about-title">关于</h2>
    <div><p>我有 12 年设计经验，从刊物和品牌视觉逐渐转向大屏、后台与 App。现在也自己制作原型和工具，借助 AI 试方案，再回到业务规则和实际操作里检查。</p></div>
  </section>
</main>
<script src="../scripts/turntable.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
